---
description: shadcn/ui component system — Radix UI primitives, Tailwind CSS v4, new-york style
globs: ["*.tsx", "*.ts", "*.css"]
---

- Components are source-code-owned (not a package dep). Edit them directly.
- Use `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` to add components. Prefer `-o` to overwrite.
- Init is done. `components.json` at root. Aliases: `@/components`, `@/lib/utils`, `@/components/ui`.
- Style: `new-york`. Base: `zinc`. CSS variables in `@theme inline`.
- All components use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for class merging.
- Font: Geist Sans / Geist Mono via `next/font/google`. Set literal names in `@theme inline`, not `var(--font-geist-sans)`.
- Use shadcn primitives before raw HTML elements. Button, Card, Dialog, etc. first.
- Dark mode via `className="dark"` on `<html>`.
